# What the build job of release.yml installs to make the wheel and the sdist of
# lustro-cli with `python -m build --no-isolation`: the build frontend, and the
# build backend that lustro-cli/pyproject.toml names. The job installs
# release-build.txt, which locks these and their dependencies with hashes. To
# lock them again, in a virtual environment with pip-tools:
#
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --strip-extras \
#     .github/requirements/release-build.in
build
hatchling
